## Summary
Talk To Me In Korean is hosting a book giveaway where 20 winners will receive a free copy of the upcoming book 'Korean Folktales in Everyday Conversation'. To participate, customers must leave reviews on TTMIK's website for books purchased there between October 27 and November 12, 2023. Winners will be announced on November 17, 2023.

## Key Points
- 20 winners will receive the new book 'Korean Folktales in Everyday Conversation' as a gift.
- Participants must leave reviews on TTMIK's website for books they have purchased to enter the giveaway.
- The giveaway period is from October 27 to November 12, 2023, with automatic entry for reviews left during this time.
- Winners will be randomly selected and announced on November 17, 2023, contacted via email.


